      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "-Wonderfully Presented and Spacious 3 Bedroomed Apartment\r\n\r\n-Expansive and Unrestricted Views of Killiney Hill and Beyond\r\n\r\n-Large Private Balcony\r\n\r\n-Light & Bright Gable End Residence\r\n\r\n-Short Stroll To LUAS\r\n\r\nPremium Collection are proud to bring to the market this wonderfully presented and spacious 3 bedroomed gable end apartment in the highly sought after Tullyvale development located in the heart of Cherrywood.Comprising over 950 sqft this residence offers an outstanding combination of space, comfort and convenience being only a short stroll from the LUAS and providing the host of amenities that Cherrywood provides.\r\n\r\nA large central hallway leads to a spacious, light, and bright living room with wood floors and a feature fireplace. A spacious and private balcony is accessed through floor to ceiling glass doors directly from the livingroom which offers expansive and unobstructed views toward Killiney Hill and beyond. The open plan floorplan seamlessly joins the living room to a light filled kitchen/dining room illuminated  by an oversized gable bay window. The wonderful upgraded kitchen comprises ample shaker style cabinetry with integrated appliances colourful wall tiles and large 24\" x 18\" floor tiles with a dining area in the bay window that utilises the space to maximum efficiency.\r\n\r\nComprising three spacious bedrooms all with fitted wardrobes and a large master bedroom including a shower room ensuite there is excellent separation between all of the rooms with the recently renovated main bathroom centrally located and comprising a bath and shower combination with white floor to ceiling tile.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
